144
00:10:33,947 --> 00:10:34,908
Hüseyin Avni Paşa,

145
00:10:35,827 --> 00:10:37,408
Rüştü Paşa gibi isimler.

146
00:10:37,687 --> 00:10:38,408
Ama Mithat Paşa

147
00:10:38,408 --> 00:10:39,947
özellikle aklımızda kalmalı.

148
00:10:41,048 --> 00:10:41,888
Yani kendisi

149
00:10:41,888 --> 00:10:43,707
